  {
    "simkl_id": 1375946,
    "title": "1899",
    "year": 2022,
    "author": "Cruezxsp",
    "reason": "If you haven’t watched 1899, you’re missing a deeply mysterious and visually stunning series from the creators of Dark. Set aboard a ship filled with passengers from different backgrounds, it slowly unravels into a complex puzzle full of tension and hidden layers. The atmosphere is haunting, the storytelling is clever, and every episode pulls you deeper into the unknown. It’s the kind of show that keeps you thinking and theorizing long after each episode ends—perfect if you love suspense and mind-bending narratives without easy answers",
